OL,3,AFlights at major US airports delayed
OL,4,Aafter cable cut by construction workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FTelecommunications company Verizon,
OL,7,Fwhich owns the cable, told US media it
OL,8,Fwas working to repair it "as quickly as
OL,9,Fpossible" and that it "bears no
OL,10,Fresponsibility" for the incident.
